    "preamble": "Sanpreet Singh Chabra, S/O Shri Surjeet ... vs State Of Rajasthan on 5 November, 2020 Author: Ashok Kumar Gaur Bench: Ashok Kumar Gaur High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan Bench At Jaipur S.B. Civil Writ Petition No. 12953/2020 1. Sanpreet Singh Chabra, S/o Shri Surjeet Singh Chabra, Food Businessman/sub-Licensee (Gujrat Co-Operative Milk Marketing Federation Limited-Licensee)-Amul Milk Parlour- Platform No. 1, Near Rms Office, Railway Station, Udaipur-313001 2. Arvind Garg S/o Shri Ramesh Kumar Garg, Food Businessman/sub-Licensee Amul Milk Parlour(Gujrat Co- Operative Milk Marketing Federation Limited-Licensee)- Amul Milk Parlour- Platform No. 1, Near Rms Office, Railway Station, Udaipur-313001 3. Branch Manager- Gujrat Co-Operative Milk Marketing Federation Limited (Gcmmfl), Licensee-Amul Milk Parlour Railway Station- Platform No. 1, Near Rms Office, Udaipur-313001 4. Manish Ahlawat, M/s Mangla Trading Company, Amul Fmcg Products Frozen Items, 07 Toran Bawdi, Mewar Motors Gali, Udyapole, Udaipur-313001 5. M/s Gujrat Co-Operative Milk Marketing Federation Limited, Gcmmfl Plot No. 5 And 6, Roshan Ji Ki Badi, Udaipur-313001 6. Naresh Shah, Deputy Manager (Quality Assurance)- Nominee-Amul Fed Dairy, (A Unit Of Gcmmfl) ( Previously Known As Mother Dairy, Gandhi Nagar Bhatt-Gujrat- 382428) 7.",
